    "Word (.docx)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Word (.docx)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Word documents are turned into PDF by Microsoft Word when it's installed, so the layout matches. The PDF engine (pdf2docx and pdfplumber, downloaded from PyPI into NotchIsland's folder) keeps the layout when converting PDF to Word and finds tables when converting PDF to Excel or CSV. It needs Python 3." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dokumen Word diubah menjadi PDF oleh Microsoft Word bila terpasang, sehingga tata letaknya sama. Mesin PDF (pdf2docx dan pdfplumber, diunduh dari PyPI ke folder NotchIsland) menjaga tata letak saat mengonversi PDF ke Word dan mendeteksi tabel saat mengonversi PDF ke Excel atau CSV. Membutuhkan Python 3."
          }
        }
      }
    },
